      "rationale": "Amos ka sariya-jate kɔkanna: jurumu sabala, ani naani — jate-sira min bɛ fɔ a yɛrɛ tɛ kɛ sariya jatebɔ ye, nka a bɛ janya ka na kɔrɔ-dɔnni ma."
