      "rationale": "Tora ye sɛbɛnni-yɛlɛma daɲɛ ye min b'a laɲini — a tɛ bayɛlɛma 'sariya' kelen-kelen ye (da, sariya, walimaya bɛ a kɔnɔ)."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Cogo nin na Yawe ye fɔ ko: Yehuda ka jurumu sabala de ye, ani naani, ni bɛɛ ye naani, n tɛ a yɛlɛmɛ — sabu u ka Yawe ka ⟨את⟩ Tora baliya, ani a ka sariyahingow u ma a mara; u dɔgɔkuw ye u majan, minnu kɔ a baw tun ye taa.",
